# Operating-system files
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store

# Dependencies and generated output
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/out/
**/dist/
**/coverage/
**/.wrangler/
**/.pnp
**/.pnp.*
**/.yarn/*
!**/.yarn/patches
!**/.yarn/plugins
!**/.yarn/releases
!**/.yarn/versions

# Logs and local tooling
**/dev*.log
**/dev*.err
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/.pnpm-debug.log*
**/.vercel/
